sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Customer
  participant Uniquworld
  participant Razorpay
  participant Shiprocket
  participant Courier
  participant YourOffice

  Customer->>Uniquworld: Place order + shipping address
  Uniquworld->>Uniquworld: Save order (status pending)

  alt Online payment
    Uniquworld->>Razorpay: Create Razorpay order
    Razorpay-->>Customer: Checkout modal
    Customer->>Razorpay: Pay
    Razorpay-->>Uniquworld: Payment verified
    Uniquworld->>Uniquworld: Order confirmed
  else Cash on delivery
    Uniquworld->>Uniquworld: Order confirmed
  end

  Uniquworld->>Shiprocket: Create order (pickup Primary)
  Shiprocket-->>Uniquworld: AWB / shipment id
  Uniquworld->>Uniquworld: Order processing

  Note over YourOffice: Pack, label, schedule pickup

  Courier->>YourOffice: Pick up parcel
  Courier->>Customer: Deliver to address
  Uniquworld->>Uniquworld: Order delivered
